# Secrets (Req 1.4) -- only .env.example is committed
.env

# Agent run artifacts (Req 1.4). Anchored to the repository root with a leading
# slash: an unanchored `traces/` matches a directory of that name at any depth,
# which silently excluded `evals/traces/` -- the 13 committed trace files that
# `evals/results.md` and `docs/injection_run.md` cite as evidence. The
# operator's own run artifacts stay ignored; the eval evidence is tracked.
/notes.md
/traces/
/run.jsonl

# Chroma persistence directory (Req 1.4)
/.chroma/

